Gate fix for Lead: give research-gate.py and check-docs.py the same repo switch
check-rules.py already has, and make research-gate print its problems.

Why (evidence, 2026-11-14):
- scripts/research-gate.py:34 and scripts/check-docs.py:24 both hardcode
  REPO = '/mnt/e/hackios/UniXNU-mondrian', the shared checkout owned by touch-agent.
  Any other line that runs them gets the main checkout's numbers, not its own:
  in /mnt/e/hackios/k60-refmine the shipped scripts report "32 reference sources"
  and "187 items" while the same scripts pointed at that tree report
  "50 reference sources" and "189 items".
- scripts/research-gate.py:88 calls check() without verbose, so the problems list
  is never printed: a failing run emits only "结论: ❌ 研究完整性未通过" with no reason.
  scripts/check-rules.py:75-79 already accepts --repo, so the pattern exists.

Verified with this patch applied to copies in /mnt/e/k60-work/scratch/refmine/gate:
  K60_REPO=/mnt/e/hackios/k60-refmine python3 fixed-research-gate.py
    -> 已考察 50 个参考源 / 结论: ✅ 研究完整性通过 / rc=0
  K60_REPO=/mnt/e/hackios/k60-refmine python3 fixed-check-docs.py
    -> 共检查 189 项 / 结论: ✅ 文档一致性通过 / rc=0
With K60_REPO unset both keep the current behaviour (main checkout), so applying
this changes no existing result.

Apply from the repository root with:  git apply docs/research/evidence/gate-repo-switch.diff

